  "_about": "Every spoken dialect the Colloquial tab offers. A dialect is a folder of unit files beside this one, nothing more: adding one is a folder and a line here, with no code change anywhere. `voice` is who says its lines aloud: a native speaker of it (services/speech.py `voice_named`); without one, the Fusha voice reads them.",
